Perfect 👍
Tumhe **API hit karke Jenkins job trigger karna hai** — ye 100% possible hai.

Server: **Jenkins**

Main tumhe 3 methods bata raha hoon 👇

---

# ✅ METHOD 1 (Recommended) — Build with Token (Simple)

## 🔥 Step 1: Job me Token Enable karo

1. Jenkins → Job → Configure
2. Build Triggers section me jao
3. ✔ **Trigger builds remotely (e.g., from scripts)**
4. Authentication Token set karo:

```
my-secret-token
```

Save.

---

## 🔥 Step 2: API URL

```
http://JENKINS_URL/job/JOB_NAME/build?token=my-secret-token
```

Example:

```
http://13.234.45.67:8080/job/project-1/build?token=my-secret-token
```

---

## 🔥 Step 3: Curl se Trigger karo

```bash
curl -X POST "http://13.234.45.67:8080/job/project-1/build?token=my-secret-token"
```

---

# ✅ METHOD 2 — API Token (Secure Method)

Better secure method 👇

---

## Step 1: API Token Generate karo

1. Jenkins → User → Configure
2. API Token → Generate

---

## Step 2: Curl with Auth

```bash
curl -X POST \
  http://JENKINS_URL/job/JOB_NAME/build \
  --user username:API_TOKEN
```

Example:

```bash
curl -X POST \
  http://13.234.45.67:8080/job/project-1/build \
  --user admin:123456abcdef
```

---

# ✅ METHOD 3 — Parameterized Job Trigger

Agar parameters pass karne ho:

```bash
curl -X POST \
  http://JENKINS_URL/job/project-1/buildWithParameters \
  --user admin:API_TOKEN \
  --data BRANCH_NAME=master
```

---

# ⚠️ IMPORTANT (CSRF Issue)

Agar error aaye:

```
No valid crumb was included in the request
```

To crumb token lena padega 👇

### Crumb Get karo:

```bash
curl -u admin:API_TOKEN \
  http://JENKINS_URL/crumbIssuer/api/json
```

Fir use karo:

```bash
curl -X POST \
  -u admin:API_TOKEN \
  -H "Jenkins-Crumb:CRUMB_VALUE" \
  http://JENKINS_URL/job/project-1/build
```

---

# 🎯 Most Common Use Case (GitHub Webhook)

Agar tum **GitHub** se auto trigger chahte ho:

Webhook URL:

```
http://JENKINS_URL/github-webhook/
```

Job me enable karo:

✔ GitHub hook trigger for GITScm polling

---

# 🚀 Final Recommendation

| Method       | Secure | Use Case      |
| ------------ | ------ | ------------- |
| build?token= | Medium | Quick testing |
| API Token    | ✅      | Production    |
| Webhook      | ✅✅     | Auto CI/CD    |

